,"bead_id":"sase-sk.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-sk[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Replace toobig_split revision dedupe with conditional admission[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]AXE retries oversized-file maintenance without repository-HEAD [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]dedupe keys, and each queued toobig_split proposal uses durable %if[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]admission to allocate no agent or workspace unless its target file [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is still at least 700 lines long.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]toobig_split_conditional_admission.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/toobig_split_conditional_admission.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-sk[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-sk/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable typed admission for AXE chop proposals[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]axe-chop-typed-admission[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]axe-chop-typed-admission: route flag-enabled AXE proposals containing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]%if or %proc through the existing durable typed coordinator, preserve [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-proposal chop ownership across detached waits, and settle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skipped/error/launched units correctly in chop lifecycle state.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Admission-gate toobig_split at the configured line floor[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]toobig-if-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after axe-chop-typed-admission[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]toobig-if-guard: remove repository-HEAD and proposal-dedupe behavior [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from bugyi-chops, emit a safe per-file %if Bash fence that rechecks the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]configured minimum line limit, and prove stale files skip while eligible[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]files still launch.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remove revision-key guidance and roll out the guarded chop[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]conditional-admission-rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after axe-chop-typed-admission, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]toobig-if-guard[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]conditional-admission-rollout: replace the prior HEAD-key documentation [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and dotfiles wording with the conditional-admission contract, deploy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compatible SASE and bugyi-chops builds, and verify a live toobig_split [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]run end to end.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-sk","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-sk.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-bed54c0d30e222cae059438665a06ac7","started_at":"2026-08-23T20:22:23.648622+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"75f687051d9caeebfa561e6fb4f608745a455c8ba893d00b1563407af54b5c27","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-sk.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-sk.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"8525d2ba12fd1d1